1.1 AuthController.cs
Purpose: Handles user authentication, including registration, login and logout.

Add this explanation to your README:
### AuthController

The AuthController manages user authentication.
It allows new users to register as organisers or
participants. It also handles login by checking
user credentials and creating a session.

The controller supports logout by clearing the
current user's session.
